      "description": "Islamic App – Your Daily Companion for Faith\n\nStay connected to your faith anytime, anywhere with our all-in-one Islamic app designed to support your daily worship and spiritual growth.\n\n- Accurate Prayer Times\nGet precise prayer times based on your location, with customizable calculation methods and timely Athan notifications so you never miss a prayer.\n\n- Qibla Compass\nEasily find the direction of the Kaaba wherever you are with a reliable and easy-to-use Qibla compass.\n\n- Holy Quran\nRead the complete Holy Quran with a beautiful, easy-to-read interface. Enjoy smooth navigation, bookmarking, and search features for a meaningful reading experience.\n\n- Hadith Collection\nExplore authentic Hadith from trusted sources to deepen your understanding of Islam and the teachings of Prophet Muhammad (SAW).\n\n- Islamic Events & Calendar\nStay informed about important Islamic dates and events, including Ramadan, Eid, and other significant occasions.\n\n- Simple, Elegant & User-Friendly\nDesigned with simplicity and beauty in mind, this app is perfect for Muslims of all ages seeking a reliable daily Islamic companion.\n\nDownload now and strengthen your connection with Allah every day.",
